-- Backfill of per-client monthly invoicing from Holded (GET /api/v2/invoices
-- + /api/v2/credit-notes, same subtotal/EUR-conversion rules as
-- witme_invoiced_monthly), as of 2026-09-22. Covers 2025-10 through 2026-09
-- (12 months): witme_client_invoiced_monthly powers the "Revisión de
-- clientes" alert page, which needs enough trailing history for 3-month
-- comparisons across all of 2026 (Jan 2026 needs Oct-Dec 2025 as its prior
-- months), not full history back to 2023 like witme_invoiced_monthly.
-- Kept up to date going forward by the weekly sync (Parte 4).
--
-- invoice_ids holds each invoice's Holded document id (most recent first),
-- letting the UI deep-link straight to it: https://app.holded.com/sales/revenue#open:invoice-<id>.
-- Credit notes are excluded from invoice_ids (they don't have that same
-- open-by-id URL) and are only netted into invoiced_eur/invoice_count.

on conflict (year, month, contact_id) do update set contact_name = excluded.contact_name, invoiced_eur = excluded.invoiced_eur, invoice_count = excluded.invoice_count, invoice_ids = excluded.invoice_ids;
